+I work on building high-performing quantum memory for quantum information processing and networking. I've implemented memory schemes on erbium-doped thin-film lithium niobate (Er:TFLN), storing telecom-band single photons for over a microsecond &mdash; a record efficiency-storage-time product for any integrated nanophotonic platform, as described in our Nano Letters manuscript below.
+
+I'm currently pursuing approaches to push memory efficiency even higher using slow light.
