+I couple plasmonic and photonic structures to enhance fluorescence emission from dye molecules, driven by enhanced electric fields, improved emission collection, and Purcell-enhanced emission rate. I've applied these effects to biosensing, enabling ultrasensitive, digital-resolution detection of single protein molecules, as described in the publication below.
